Hi,

We have an Alpha 164 LX which had been working well for

1 year now. Lately we had some hardware troubles and

replaced mainboard, graphics card, RAM and CPU to find

out what was bothering. We didn't find out though, but suddenly

the machine came back to life (with the new mainboard).

Now I tried to load LILO the way I used to from the harddisk.

Strange enough it did not succeed, and I am not sure

how to interpret the result.

